  "title": "Pumpkin Pecan No-Bake Cheesecake Pie",
  "description": "Pumpkin pecan pie and cheesecake combine into a no-bake pie for a new dessert for the holiday table.",
  "authors": [
    "Melissa Goff"
  ],
